2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Larsdotter  1755-    
2 CONT
2 CONT Född 1755. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT   Gift  
2 CONT     Nils Johansson  Född 1754 i Åkullsjön nr 6, Bygdeå församling (AC).  Död 1786. 
2 CONT
2 CONT        Barn 
2 CONT       Johannes Nilsson.  Född 1783-07-04 i Åkullsjön nr 6, Bygdeå församling (AC). 
2 CONT
2 CONT       Lars Nilsson.  Född 1785-08-12 i Åkullsjön nr 7, Bygdeå församling (AC). 
2 CONT
2 CONT       Maja Lisa Nilsdotter.  Född 1786-11-06 i Åkullsjön nr 7, Bygdeå församling (AC). 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Gift  
2 CONT     Anders Mårtensson   Född 1756.  Bonde. 
2 CONT
2 CONT        Barn 
2 CONT       Mårten Andersson.  Född 1789-09-01 i Åkullsjön nr 7, Bygdeå församling (AC). 
2 CONT
2 CONT       Stina Cajsa Andersdotter.  Född 1793-10-04 i Åkullsjön nr 7, Bygdeå församling (AC). 
2 CONT
2 CONT       Andreas Andersson.   Född 1797-08-01 i Åsjön nr 7, Åkullsjön, Bygdeå församling (AC). 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.anor.pchemma.nu/data/000/0031/537.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina was born 1755 and was from Ytterklinten. She first married Nils Johansson 1782 and had three children. In 1786 Nils died of gout and bone-ache at 32 years old. Birger Sjöström writes: "In 1788, the widow Catharina remarr
2 CONC ied to Anders Mårtensson. He had come to Åkullsjön in 1787, probably to "homestead number 7", that this farm in Åsjön was named at the time. He came from Burträsk parish . . . "
2 CONT
2 CONT Allan Anderson notes:
2 CONT ff ff;    3rd great-grandma, who is also sister-in-law to great-great grandpa Mårten Andersson and wife of  Grandpa Anderson's grand uncle. She 1st wed  Nils Johansson and is shown as a family Åkullsjön A1:4.74 (1771-1788); Nils a
2 CONC  Bonde (farmer) in Åkullsjön Oct. 1782;  Catharina was from Ytterklinten. It ends after 4 years, when her husband dies from gout--leaving his young widow with 3 kids: 1 baby + a 1 year old. She remarries 2nd to Anders Mårtensson, 
2 CONC who gallops to the rescue. Widow with kids + new husband, Anders M., shown at Åkullsjön 3, A1:5.92 (1784-97).
2 CONT Shown @Åsjön, Bygdeå, A1:6.87 (1797-1807) with Anders M. + stepkids + kids.
2 CONT Husband Anders lives on to age 59; dies when falling from tree; Catharina lived to age 62 in nearby Åsjön. All on farm #7, Åkullsjön, Bygdeå, Västerbotten (it incorrectly lists Catherina b 1755 d 1817-08-09, Åsjön).
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina's first husband was Nils Johansson (b 4/4/1754 - d 12/24/1786). They had 3 children: eldest son Johan Nilsson (7/4/1783 - 3/31/1854), 1 year old Lars Nilsson (8/12/1785 - 9/26/1848), and Maja Lisa Nilsdotter (3/6/1786-).
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Larsdotter, änka (widow) in Åkullsjön.
2 CONT On 1788-06-21 she remarries Anders Mårtensson, a Bonde (farmer) of Burträsk at Åkullsjön 6, Larsdotter, Catharina, änka (widow) 1788-06-21  Mårtensson, Anders, Burträsk, bonde.
2 CONT As wife of Anders Mårtensson (9/10/1756 - 11/30/1814), she has 11 more children, including Mårten Andersson, grandpa Anderson's grandfather. Church household exam roll shows knowledge of Luther's Cathechism, communion, and who has
2 CONC  been vaccinated against the dreaded killer smallpox, using cowpox as a vaccine (discovered because milkmaids never got smallpox).
2 CONT Catharina's cause of death: Gikt & Tandvärk (Gout and Toothache).
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT Kråken 14 person 120957, https://kråken.se/
