1 OCCU Bonde
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was  owner (Bonde) of Farm at Edfastmark 3, Bygdeå, like his father Håkan Nilsson. The farm is inherited by his son Zachris Olafsson, his eldest son leaving his younger son, my ancestor Anders Olsson, to become 
2 CONC an innkeeper and restauranteur in Rickleå, Bygdeå. Pinky calls him #448 and confirms dates/occupation/wife; states that he died at Edfastmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dmb (Court Judgment Book) 1651 7/11: some dispute between two brothers Nils Håkansson and Olof Håkansson in Edfastmark about their inheritance in house and land, so because Nils is the older brother and cannot reconcile with his m
2 CONC other; the mother wants the younger brother to keep the homestead... give Olof him 100 dalers kpmt.. that Nils's wife has beaten her mother-in-law.. (from Geni).
2 CONT Dmb 1674 16/6 .. Olof Håkansson's daughters Annika and Margareta at the age of 15, that Olof Håkansson's wife Barbro Nilsdotter said that wife Brita... Olof Håkansson's son Zackarias at the age of 11 (from Olofsson).
2 CONT
2 CONT Y-DNA verified via at least two sons. Haplogroups R-Y65699 (kit 320338) and R-CTS3390 (kit 310153)
2 CONT
2 CONT Y-DNA sources:
2 CONT https://www.familytreedna.com/groups/sweden/about/results (Sverigeprojektet) https://www.familytreedna.com/public/Skelleftea?iframe=yresults (Skellefteå and nearby parishes)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kurt Andersson, https://www.qhurth.com/anor/0001/41369.htm
2 CONT https://genea.se/Lars-Gunnar/lgk/sida1/h____1pj.htm
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 259635 gives source "Mantel, DmB 1651" for birth.
2 CONT Agneta Olofsson, "Bygdeå Byar och Gårdar," (2006) p. 355, Edfastmark 3.
2 CONT
