1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Per Jonsson is confirmed in 1670: "Per Joensson 11 years between Matsmäss and Vårfru". Per is stated to be a farmer in 1699 in Sjulsmark 2 on 3/8 mantal or 3 acres. In 1719, he handed over the homestead to his son
2 CONC  Moses." (genea.se).
2 CONT
2 CONT Kurt Andersson gives 1729 as his death, but I find no source. It could be a copy error from 1719.
