1 NOTE {geni:about_me} She lived Åkullsjön, Bygdeå Våsterbotten from birth to marriage.
2 CONT She is first shown in birth book, C:3.144, w/godparents Arvid A. +Anna Stina Nathdotter i Åkullsjön + Olof L. + Magdalena + Olof L. + Maja Stina L.
2 CONT Then on A1:5A.86 (1784+1797) in Åkullsjön farm#1 w/parents+siblings; in Åkullsjön, Bygdeå, her father Nils dies 1809 and she lives w/widowed mom of  3 girls +9 yr. old boy.  Moved from Åkullsjön to Åsjön, Bygdeå to marry Mårten A.
2 CONC  She lived in Åsjön from marriage to death, 1854. Listed in marriage book as Nilsdotter, Stina Cajsa .Piga Åkullsjön, 1812-09-14; Andersson, Mårten .Bondeson, Åsjön, C:3:330 (1781-1829), SOK image ID C0034039_00185.
2 CONT Death register show her dead at age 57 years, 11 months, 15 days in Åsjön, 1854-09-11. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Shown with Mårten A. and kids, Anders, Pehr, Maria Charlotta, Brita, Ingrid Mag., & Eva, A1:11A.199 (1838-45) at Åsjön.Then on 1854-09-11 she dies: Bonde hans hustru Stina Cajsa Nilsdotter (57 år 11 m 15 d).
2 CONT
